hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1605","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mera haath pakra aur farmaya: Allah Taala ne mitti Hafta ke din paida ki, us mein pahar Itwaar ke din paida kiye, darakht Peer ke din paida kiye, napasandeeda cheezein Mangal ke din paida keen, noor Budh ke din paida kiya, us mein janwar Jumeraat ke din phailaye, aur Adam ko Juma ke din Asr ke waqt paida kiya, aakhri makhlooq mein, Juma ki ghaṛiyon mein se aakhri ghari mein, Asr se raat ke darmiyan. (Muslim: 8/127). Baab: Ibrahim Khalil (alaihissalam) ki fazilat ke baaray mein."
"1606","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae makhlooq mein behtareen! To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo Ibrahim (alaihissalam) hain. (Muslim: 7/97). Baab: Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke khatna ke baaray mein."
"1607","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim Nabi (alaihissalam) ne khatna karaya jabke wo assi saal ke thay, qadum se. (Muslim: 7/97). Baab: Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke qaul: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe dikha Tu murdon ko kaisay zinda karta hai, aur Loot aur Yusuf (alaihimussalam) ka zikr. (Qadum badhai ka aala hai, kaha gaya ke Shaam mein aik jagah hai.)"
"1608","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ham Ibrahim se shak mein zyada haq rakhtay hain jab unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab! Mujhe dikha Tu murdon ko kaisay zinda karta hai. Us ne farmaya: Kya tum iman nahi laye? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, lekin taake mera dil mutmaeen ho. Aur Allah Loot par rehem karay, beshak wo mazboot saharay ki taraf panah letay thay. Aur agar main Yusuf ke qaid ki muddat qaid mein rehta to bulanay walay ko qabool kar leta. (Muslim: 7/98). Baab: Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke qaul: Beshak main beemar hun, aur balke ye un ke baray ne kiya, aur Sara ke baaray mein ke wo meri behan hain."
"1609","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ibrahim Nabi (alaihissalam) ne kabhi jhoot nahi bola siwae teen jhooton ke, ye istilah mein jhoot kehlaye hain, haqeeqat mein jhoot nahi balke tauriya ki aik shakal hain. Un mein se do Allah ke liye thay: Aik un ka qaul ke beshak main beemar hun, aur doosra un ka qaul ke balke ye un ke baray ne kiya hoga. Teesra jhoot Sayyida Sara (alaihassalam) ke baaray mein tha. Us ka qissa ye hai ke Ibrahim (alaihissalam) aik zalim baadshah ke mulk mein pahunche, un ke saath un ki biwi Sayyida Sara thin jo bari khoobsurat thin. Unhon ne apni biwi se kaha ke is zalim baadshah ko agar maloom hoga ke tu meri biwi hai to mujh se chheen le ga, is liye agar wo poochay to ye kehna ke main is shakhs ki behan hun, aur tu Islam ke rishtay se meri behan hai. Ye bhi kuch jhoot na tha, is liye ke sari duniya mein aaj mere aur tere siwa koi Musalman maloom nahi hota. Jab Ibrahim (alaihissalam) us ki amal daari se guzar rahay thay to us zalim baadshah ke kaarinday us ke paas gaye aur bayan kiya ke tere mulk mein aisi aurat aayi hai jo tere siwa kisi ke laiq nahi. Us ne Sayyida Sara ko bula bheja. Wo gayeen to Ibrahim (alaihissalam) namaz ke liye khaday ho gaye, Allah se dua karnay lagay us ke shar se bachnay ke liye. Jab Sayyida Sara us zalim ke paas pahunchin to us ne be-ikhtiyar apna haath un ki taraf badhaya, lekin foran us ka haath sookh gaya. Wo bola ke tu Allah se dua kar ke mera haath khul jaye, main tujhe nahi sataun ga. To unhon ne dua ki aur us ka haath khul gaya. Phir us ne dobara haath badhaya to phir sookh gaya. Teen baar aisa hua. Phir us ne apne kaarindon se kaha: Tum mere paas aurat nahi laye, balke shaitaan laye ho. Us ne Hajira ko un ki khidmat ke liye diya. Phir Sara Ibrahim (alaihissalam) ke paas aayin jabke wo namaz mein thay. Unhon ne haath se ishara kiya ke kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ne kafir ko ruswa kiya aur Hajira khadima di. (Muslim)."
"1610","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Musa (alaihissalam) haya walay mard thay. Unhon ne kaha: To wo kabhi nangay nahi dekhay jatay thay. Unhon ne kaha: To Bani Israil ne kaha ke wo aadar hain, yani un ke khusyay baray hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne chotay pani ke paas ghusl kiya aur apna kapra pathar par rakha. To pathar daudnay laga aur wo us ke peechay apni laathi se usay maartay hue gaye: Mera kapra, pathar, mera kapra, pathar. Yahan tak ke wo Bani Israil ke giroh par rukay. Aur naazil hui: Ae iman walon! Un jaisay na ho jao jinhon ne Musa ko takleef di, to Allah ne unhein us se bari kar diya jo unhon ne kaha, aur wo Allah ke nazdeek izzat walay thay. (Muslim: 7/99). Baab: Musa aur Khizr (alaihimussalam) ke qissay ke baaray mein. (Aadar se murad khusyon ka bara hona hai; muwaih pani ki tasgheer hai.)"
"1611","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se kaha ke Nauf Bikali kehta hai ke Musa (alaihissalam) jo Bani Israil ke Nabi thay wo aur hain, aur jo Musa Khizr (alaihissalam) ke paas gaye thay wo aur hain. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ka dushman jhoot bolta hai. Main ne Ubayy bin Ka'b se suna, wo kehtay thay ke main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap farmatay thay ke Musa (alaihissalam) apni qaum Bani Israil par khutba padhnay ko khaday hue. Un se poocha gaya ke sab logon mein zyada ilm kis ko hai? Unhon ne kaha ke mujh ko hai. Ye baat Allah Taala ko napasand hui. Phir Allah Taala ne un par is wajah se narazgi ka izhaar kiya ke unhon ne ye nahi kaha ke Allah Taala khoob janta hai. Phir Allah Taala ne un ko wahi bheji ke do daryaon ke milap par Mera aik banda hai, wo tujh se zyada aalim hai. Musa (alaihissalam) ne arz kiya ke Ae Parwardigar! Main us se kaisay milun? Hukm hua ke aik machli tokray mein rakh, jahan wo machli gum ho jaye wahin wo banda milay ga. Ye sun kar Musa (alaihissalam) apne saathi Yusha bin Noon (alaihissalam) ko saath le kar chalay aur unhon ne aik machli tokray mein rakh li. Donon chaltay chaltay sakhra ke paas pahunche to Musa (alaihissalam) aur un ke saathi so gaye. Machli tadpi yahan tak ke tokray se nikal kar darya mein ja pari aur Allah Taala ne pani ka behna us par se rok diya, yahan tak ke pani khada ho kar taaq ki tarah ho gaya aur machli ke liye khushk rasta ban gaya. Phir wo dono aagay badhay. Jab din chadh aaya to Musa (alaihissalam) ne apne saathi se kaha: Hamara nashta lao, beshak ham ne apne is safar mein thakan payi hai. To unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne dekha jab ham pathar ke paas thehray thay to main machli bhool gaya tha, aur mujhe shaitaan ke siwa kisi ne nahi bhulaya ke main usay yaad karun. Aur us ne ajeeb taur par darya mein apna rasta bana liya. Musa (alaihissalam) ne farmaya: Wohi to ham chahtay thay. To wo donon apne qadmon ke nishanon par wapas hue. To unhon ne Khizr (alaihissalam) ko paya jo kapra odhay hue thay. Musa (alaihissalam) ne unhein salam kiya. Khizr ne kaha: Tumhari zameen mein salam kaisa? Unhon ne kaha: Main Musa hun. Khizr ne kaha: Bani Israil wala Musa? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Khizr ne farmaya ke tum mere saath hargiz sabar na kar sako ge. Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha: Tum mujhe inshaAllah sabir pao ge aur main tumharay kisi hukm ki nafarmani nahi karun ga. Khizr ne farmaya: Phir agar tum meri pairwi karo to mujh se kisi cheez ke baaray mein na poochna yahan tak ke main tum se us ka zikr karun. Phir wo donon chalay yahan tak ke kashti mein sawaar hue. To Khizr ne us mein suraakh kar diya. Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha: Kya tum ne usay is liye phaar diya ke us walon ko gharaq karo? Beshak tum ne bari baat ki. Khizr ne kaha: Kya main ne nahi kaha tha ke tum mere saath hargiz sabar na kar sako ge? Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha: Meri bhool par mujhe na pakro aur mere muamlay mein mujh par tangi na karo. Phir wo donon chalay yahan tak ke larkon ke saath khel nay walay larkay se milay. To Khizr ne usay pakar kar us ka sar tor diya. Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha: Kya tum ne paak jaan ko baghair jaan ke qatl kiya? Beshak tum ne buri baat ki. Khizr ne kaha: Kya main ne tum se nahi kaha tha ke tum mere saath hargiz sabar na kar sako ge? Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha: Agar main is ke baad tum se kuch poochun to mujhe saath na rakhna, beshak tum meri taraf se uzr ko pahunch gaye ho. Phir wo donon chalay yahan tak ke aik basti walon ke paas aaye. To unhon ne un se khana manga to unhon ne un ki mehmaan nawazi se inkar kar diya. To unhon ne wahan aik deewar payi jo girna chahti thi. To Khizr ne usay seedha kar diya. Musa (alaihissalam) ne kaha: Agar tum chahtay to us par ujrat letay. Khizr ne farmaya: Ye mere aur tumharay darmiyan judai hai. Main tumhein un cheezon ki taabeer bataun ga jin par tum sabar na kar sakay. Raha kashti, to wo miskeenon ki thi jo darya mein kaam kartay thay. To main ne chaha ke usay aibdaar kar dun, aur un ke peechay aik baadshah tha jo har kashti zabardasti pakar leta tha. Aur raha larka, to us ke maan baap momin thay. To hamein khauf hua ke wo unhein sarkashi aur kufr mein phansa de ga, wo kafir tha, taabeer ki surat mein. To ham ne chaha ke un ka Rab unhein us se behtar paakiza aur rehem mein zyada qareeb de. Aur rahi deewar, to wo shehar mein do yateem larkon ki thi, aur us ke neechay un ka khazana tha, aur un ka baap naik tha. To tumharay Rab ne chaha ke wo apni jawani ko pahunchein aur apna khazana nikaalein, tumharay Rab ki rehemat se. Aur main ne ye apni rai se nahi kiya. Yehi un cheezon ki taabeer hai jin par tum sabar na kar sakay. (Muslim)."
"1612","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke aik Yahudi apna samaan paish kar raha tha jis par usay kuch diya gaya jo us ne napasand kiya ya pasand na kiya, Abdul Aziz ko shak hai, us ne kaha: Nahi, us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Musa ko insanon par muntakhab kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To Ansaar mein se aik mard ne suna aur us ka chehra thappar se maara. Us ne kaha: Tum kehtay ho: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Musa ko insanon par muntakhab kiya, jabke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamaray darmiyan hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Yahudi Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas gaya aur kaha: Ae Abul Qasim! Beshak mera zimma aur ahad hai. Aur kaha ke falan ne mera chehra maara. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne us ka chehra kyun maara? Us ne kaha: Us ne kaha, Ae Allah ke Rasool: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ne Musa ko insanon par muntakhab kiya, jabke Aap hamaray darmiyan hain. Unhon ne kaha: To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghussa hue yahan tak ke Aap ke chehray mein ghussa pehchana gaya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke Nabiyon ke darmiyan fazilat na do. Beshak suur mein phoonka jaye ga to jo aasmanon aur zameen mein hain sab behosh ho jayein ge siwae jisay Allah chahay. Unhon ne kaha: Phir us mein doosri baar phoonka jaye ga to main pehla uthaya janay wala hun ga, ya awwal uthaye janay walon mein hon ga. To Musa Arsh pakray hue honge. To mujhe maloom nahi ke un ka Toor ke behosh honay ka hisab hua ya mujh se pehle uthaye gaye. Aur main nahi kehta ke koi Yunus bin Matta (alaihissalam) se afzal hai. (Muslim: 7/100-101). Baab: Musa (alaihissalam) ki wafaat ke baaray mein."
"1613","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Maut ka farishta Musa (alaihissalam) ke paas aaya aur us se kaha: Apne Rab ko jawab do. Unhon ne kaha: To Musa (alaihissalam) ne maut ke farishtay ki aankh par thappar maara aur usay phor diya. Unhon ne kaha: To farishta Allah Taala ke paas wapas gaya aur kaha: Beshak Tune mujhe aisay banday ki taraf bheja jo maut nahi chahta, aur us ne meri aankh phor di hai. Unhon ne kaha: To Allah ne us ki aankh usay wapas kar di aur farmaya: Mere banday ke paas wapas jao aur kaho: Kya tum zindagi chahtay ho? Phir agar tum zindagi chahtay ho to apna haath bail ki peeth par rakho. To jitnay baal tumharay haath se chhup jayein tum un se itnay saal jiyo ge. Unhon ne kaha: Phir kya? Unhon ne kaha: Phir tum maro ge. Unhon ne kaha: To ab qareeb se, Ae mere Rab! Mujhe Bait-ul-Muqaddas se pathar phenknay ke fasilay par maut de. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Agar main us ke paas hota to tumhein surkh teelay ke paas rastay ke kinare us ki qabr dikhata. (Muslim: 7/100). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke qaul ke baaray mein: Main Musa (alaihissalam) ke paas se guzra jabke wo apni qabr mein namaz padh rahay thay."
"1614","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main Meraj ki raat Musa (alaihissalam) ke paas se guzra to un ko surkh teelay ke paas dekha ke wo apni qabr mein khaday namaz padh rahay thay. (Muslim). (Musa ke sehabi se murad Khizr hain; qiraat tafseer ki surat mein hai; farishta insan ki soorat mein aaya tha.)"
"1615","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Logon mein izzat wala kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Un mein sab se zyada parhezgar. Unhon ne kaha: Ham Aap se is ke baaray mein nahi poochtay. Aap ne farmaya: To Yusuf, Allah ke Nabi, Allah ke Nabi ke betay, Allah ke Nabi ke betay, Allah ke khalil ke betay. Unhon ne kaha: Ham Aap se is ke baaray mein nahi poochtay. Aap ne farmaya: To tum mujh se Arab ki kaano ke baaray mein poochtay ho? Zamanay jahiliyat mein un mein behtar wohi Islam mein behtar hain jab deen samjhein. (Muslim: 7/103). Baab: Zakariya (alaihissalam) ke zikr ke baaray mein."
"1616","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Zakariya badhai thay. (Muslim: 7/103). Baab: Yunus (alaihissalam) ke zikr ke baaray mein."
"1617","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Unhon ne kaha, yani Allah Taala ne: Mere kisi banday ke liye jaaiz nahi, Ibn Musanna ne kaha ke mere banday ke liye, ke wo kahay ke main Yunus bin Matta se behtar hun. (Muslim: 7/102). Baab: Isa (alaihissalam) ke zikr ke baaray mein."
"1618","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main duniya aur aakhirat mein Isa bin Maryam se sab se zyada qareeb hun. Unhon ne kaha: Kaisay, Ae Allah ke Rasool? Aap ne farmaya: Nabi aalaat se bhai hain, un ki maaein juda hain aur un ka deen aik hai. To hamaray darmiyan koi Nabi nahi. (Muslim: 7/96). Baab: Har paida honay walay ko shaitaan ka chhuna siwae Maryam aur un ke betay (alaihimussalam) ke. (Aalaat se murad aik baap se mukhtalif maaon se bhai hain.)"
"1619","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi bacha paida nahi hota magar shaitaan usay chubhota hai. To wo shaitaan ke chubhonay se cheekhta hua aawaz nikalta hai, siwae Maryam ke betay aur un ki (walida) ke. Phir Abu Huraira ne kaha: Agar chaho to padho: Aur beshak main usay aur us ki aulad ko shaitaan mardood se Teri panah mein deti hun. (Muslim: 7/96). Baab: Isa (alaihissalam) ke qaul: Main Allah par iman laya aur apne nafs ko jhutlaya."
"1620","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Isa bin Maryam ne aik mard ko chori kartay dekha. To Isa ne us se farmaya: Tum ne chori ki. Us ne kaha: Hargiz nahi, us Zaat ki qasam jis ke siwa koi mabood nahi. To Isa ne farmaya: Main Allah par iman laya aur apne nafs ko jhutlaya. (Muslim: 7/97). (Murad Allah ki qasam khanay walay ko sach samajhna hai; mumkin hai us ne wohi liya ho jis mein us ka haq ho.)"
